                                "sense_id": "2b31e49b-3621-361d-af64-7bddef2a8882",
                                "text": "an thou dost go on to put thy filthy lucre in the balance with thy daughter’s life and honour, by Heaven, I will strip thee of every maravedi thou hast in the world, before three days are out!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
